    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undead Rampage is a third-person co-op shooter that throws you and your friends into the epicenter of a post-apocalypse, where terrible monsters rule the ruins of civilization. Your goal is to survive at all costs, fighting hordes of enemies and collecting upgrades to strengthen your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op gameplay:</strong> Team up with friends in a team of up to 4 people and fight together, coordinating actions to achieve the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic battles:</strong> Use 2 rifles and a pistol, quickly switch between weapons to be ready for any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/5178b1b709127769f03fa5bad6635508.poster.avif?t=1748979609\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/5178b1b709127769f03fa5bad6635508.webm?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/5178b1b709127769f03fa5bad6635508.mp4?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maneuverability and evasion:</strong> Roll to avoid deadly attacks of monsters and stay alive in tense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/6c5358973b420e5ba16111b30a2d0584.poster.avif?t=1748979609\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/6c5358973b420e5ba16111b30a2d0584.webm?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/6c5358973b420e5ba16111b30a2d0584.mp4?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade system:</strong> Defeat monsters, pick up dropped upgrades and instantly strengthen your character, increasing health, speed, ammo supply or finding new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/545def759655a501ddb4c8e4c141c87a.poster.avif?t=1748979609\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/545def759655a501ddb4c8e4c141c87a.webm?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/545def759655a501ddb4c8e4c141c87a.mp4?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Breathtaking world:</strong> Explore atmospheric locations full of ruined cities, abandoned buildings and mysterious laboratories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/622905e551945b343e66c95ca646bb0a.poster.avif?t=1748979609\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/622905e551945b343e66c95ca646bb0a.webm?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/622905e551945b343e66c95ca646bb0a.mp4?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you survive and win in the chaos of the new world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/55c5ca05d9f48ad78f55ed1d57b2c305.poster.avif?t=1748979609\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/55c5ca05d9f48ad78f55ed1d57b2c305.webm?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373280/extras/55c5ca05d9f48ad78f55ed1d57b2c305.mp4?t=1748979609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
